@startuml NekoCafe_Sequence_StaffSchedule
actor "店员" as Staff
participant "Staff App" as App
participant "Reservation Service" as ResvSvc
participant "Notification Service" as NotifySvc
database "Store DB" as DB

Staff -> App : 扫描顾客预约码
App -> ResvSvc : verifyReservation(qrCode)
ResvSvc -> DB : 查询预约单状态
DB --> ResvSvc : 返回预约详情
ResvSvc --> App : 显示预约信息(人数, 偏好)

Staff -> App : 点击"确认到店并分配桌位"
App -> ResvSvc : assignTable(reservationId, tableId)
activate ResvSvc
ResvSvc -> DB : 更新 Table 状态为 "Occupied"
ResvSvc -> DB : 更新 Reservation 状态为 "Completed"
DB --> ResvSvc : 更新成功

ResvSvc -> NotifySvc : triggerArrivalNotification(userId)
activate NotifySvc
NotifySvc --> ResvSvc : 推送成功
deactivate NotifySvc

ResvSvc --> App : 返回分配成功
deactivate ResvSvc
App --> Staff : 界面提示：引导顾客至指定桌位
@enduml